        {
          "text": "**Zero-shot vs. Few-shot Prompting:** Exploring the difference between giving a direct command (zero-shot) and providing a few examples of the desired output format within your prompt (few-shot), which is highly effective for academic formatting.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 104,
          "source": "topic-set-improving-gemini-and-chatgpt-prompting-20251020222143.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Self-Consistency:** An advanced technique where you ask the model the same question multiple times using diverse reasoning paths (e.g., different CoT prompts) and then select the most consistent answer.",
