          "line_number": 108,
          "source": "topic-set-improving-gemini-and-chatgpt-prompting-20251020222143.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Prompt Frameworks (e.g., CO-STAR):** Investigating mnemonic frameworks (Context, Objective, Style, Tone, Audience, Response) that help ensure you include all necessary components in your prompt.",
